{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30401","headline":"西峰即事献沈大夫 · 赵嘏","name":"西峰即事献沈大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松竹闲游道路身，衣襟落尽往来尘。\n山连谢宅余霞在，水映琴溪旧浪春。\n拂榻从容今有地，酬恩寂寞久无人。\n安知不及屠沽者，曾对青萍泪满巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}